#: ../../index.md:14 1b432c9ab8b0407390f9cc20966a346e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A practitioner's field manual that blends IR / RAG theory with live, "
"measured code from two reference implementations — a prose-layer reference "
"implementation and a code-layer reference implementation — and expands the "
"author's methodology blog post {cite}`fanyamin2026deepwiki` into a book-"
"length treatment."
msgstr ""
"一份实战者的现场手册：把 IR / RAG 理论与两套参考实现 —— 文稿层参考实现和代码层参考实现 —— "
"中真正在跑、可被度量的代码结合起来，并把作者那篇方法论博客 {cite}`fanyamin2026deepwiki` 扩展成一本书的篇幅。"

#: ../../index.md:20 44697672ff314672b66ef95fe354485e
msgid "How to read this book"
msgstr "如何阅读本书"

#: ../../index.md:22 f9a94b22931a47b2acb85b3aea744817
msgid "Each Part follows the same six-section narrative arc:"
msgstr "每一部分都沿着同一条六段式叙事弧展开："

#: ../../index.md:24 d6f76be36cf14b86b7ce0c71f6508fa8
msgid ""
"**Why** — the problem, the cost of ignoring it, a short literature survey."
msgstr "**Why** —— 问题是什么、忽视它要付出的代价，以及一段简短的文献综述。"

#: ../../index.md:25 e4e9e90af8284bbdbc4c3ac806b36485
msgid ""
"**What** — the precise definitions, the data model, the scope boundaries."
msgstr "**What** —— 精确的定义、数据模型、以及范围的边界。"

#: ../../index.md:26 1f971e55759d4e1f854474fe67962dfb
msgid ""
"**How** — the methodology, the architecture, the code that actually runs."
msgstr "**How** —— 方法论、架构，以及真正在跑的代码。"

#: ../../index.md:27 275a8678f2274ebc9c2d9f0d61efd5df
msgid ""
"**Example** — an end-to-end recipe with commands, inputs, and expected "
"output."
msgstr "**Example** —— 一条端到端的操作配方，包括命令、输入和预期输出。"

#: ../../index.md:29 0d70ac6be79048a2861a910e74a10c4b
msgid "**Conclusion** — what we learned, what's still open, when to apply it."
msgstr "**Conclusion** —— 我们学到了什么、什么仍然是开放问题、什么时候适合把它用上。"

#: ../../index.md:30 ce4ea6e546ba4c0195cc2468031a26bc
msgid ""
"**References** — every citation used in that Part, rendered from the shared "
"`references.bib`."
msgstr "**References** —— 该部分用到的每一条引用，由共享的 `references.bib` 渲染而来。"

#: ../../index.md:33 b735d348d78644ac828387894732938e
msgid ""
"Every chapter repeats the arc in miniature. You can read the book linearly, "
"or you can dip straight into a single Part — each one stands on its own."
msgstr "每一章都会以小型化的方式重复这条叙事弧。你可以线性地读完整本书，也可以直接挑某一部分进去看 —— 每一部分都可以独立成立。"

#: ../../index.md:36 c34a9a50a8614a00b39f03520ada4e69
msgid "Sources"
msgstr "来源"

#: ../../index.md:38 5a222d25b06143a9b45077285993e235
msgid "This book draws on three primary sources:"
msgstr "本书基于三个主要来源："

#: ../../index.md:40 369f81df066a4cf789de7a348199e5bb
msgid ""
"**The prose-layer reference implementation** — a file-based wiki engine that"
" backs this book's prose-layer narrative."
msgstr "**文稿层参考实现** —— 一个基于文件的 wiki 引擎，支撑本书文稿层的叙事。"

#: ../../index.md:42 ce5de80d06ae4193b733803650adf3e3
msgid ""
"**The code-layer reference implementation** — the companion Code-RAG + "
"Knowledge-Graph engine that backs Part III."
msgstr "**代码层参考实现** —— 与之配套的 Code-RAG + 知识图谱引擎，支撑本书第三部分。"

#: ../../index.md:44 d14d5ccddc8342209523cdd419b2f059
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Blog post** *给代码仓库造一个 DeepWiki* {cite}`fanyamin2026deepwiki` — the "
"author's pre-existing methodology article, used as the book's narrative "
"spine. See `sources/blog-deepwiki-methodology/` for the vendored snapshot "
"and the non-copy policy (every chapter that cites the blog adds at least one"
" new citation, one code excerpt, and one measurement the blog did not "
"report)."
msgstr ""
"**博客文章** * 给代码仓库造一个 DeepWiki * {cite}`fanyamin2026deepwiki` —— "
"作者此前已发表的一篇方法论文章，作为全书的叙事主干。关于 vendored 快照和“非抄录”策略，见 `sources/blog-deepwiki-"
"methodology/`（每一章在引用博客时，都必须至少新增一条引用、一段代码摘录，以及一项博客里没有报告过的度量）。"

#: ../../index.md:51 c3830b88dd5c4b818e78202b50c4fa29
msgid "Relationship to the blog post"
msgstr "与博客文章的关系"

#: ../../index.md:53 01d8ae2c52a54354aebaf6b740097ed5
msgid ""
"The blog post is licensed CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0. The author holds the copyright, "
"but we preserve the ND (no-derivatives) signal for downstream readers by:"
msgstr ""
"该博客采用 CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0 许可。作者持有版权；为了对下游读者保留 ND（no-"
"derivatives，禁止演绎）的信号，我们做了以下三件事："

#: ../../index.md:56 07c1ec4c24a041ef80d6a4d3ce558cf9
msgid ""
"Vendoring the blog HTML as an **immutable** snapshot under `sources/blog-"
"deepwiki-methodology/snapshot.html`."
msgstr ""
"把博客 HTML 以 **不可变** 快照的形式 vendor 在 `sources/blog-deepwiki-"
"methodology/snapshot.html`。"

#: ../../index.md:58 85ace60e65244ee0b799ef540962c5e0
msgid "Paraphrasing and expanding the arguments in the author's own words."
msgstr "以作者自己的话，对其中的论点进行改写与扩展。"

#: ../../index.md:59 2a18009957d048b595c532ea00b26c7f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Fencing any short verbatim quote inside an `{epigraph}` block with a "
"`{cite}` to `fanyamin2026deepwiki`."
msgstr ""
"任何短小的原文引用都要放进 `{epigraph}` 块中，并附上指向 `fanyamin2026deepwiki` 的 `{cite}`。"

#: ../../index.md:62 edfc595fbf2a4dfb8d6b127734c198e3
msgid ""
"A pre-build validator (`_tools/check_blog_quotes.py`) enforces rule (3) at "
"build time."
msgstr "一个预构建校验器（`_tools/check_blog_quotes.py`）在构建时对第 (3) 条规则做强制检查。"

